msgid "目标与输出"
msgstr "Targets and outputs"

msgid "产品"
msgstr "Products"

msgid "输出均相对于 O："
msgstr "All output paths are relative to O:"

msgid "``kernel``：generated/system 内核与独立调试符号。"
msgstr "``kernel``: kernel in generated/system and separate debug symbols."

msgid "``runtime`` / ``userland``：公共运行库与所选应用。"
msgstr "``runtime`` / ``userland``: shared runtime libraries and selected applications."

msgid "``sdk``：packages/reliefos-musl-sdk.tar.gz。"
msgstr "``sdk``: packages/reliefos-musl-sdk.tar.gz."

msgid "``apk-repo``：packages/apk/repository。"
msgstr "``apk-repo``: packages/apk/repository."

msgid "``rootfs``：rootfs/managed 与 manifest.json。"
msgstr "``rootfs``: rootfs/managed and manifest.json."

msgid "``image-vmdk``：images/reliefos.raw 与 images/reliefos.vmdk。"
msgstr "``image-vmdk``: images/reliefos.raw and images/reliefos.vmdk."

msgid "``iso``：images/reliefos-live.iso。"
msgstr "``iso``: images/reliefos-live.iso."

msgid "``installer``：images/reliefos-installer.iso。"
msgstr "``installer``: images/reliefos-installer.iso."

msgid "``rpr-pages``：独立 RPR 机器接口和人类页面。"
msgstr "``rpr-pages``: standalone RPR machine interfaces and human-readable pages."

msgid "``pages``：pages/ 网站，包括下载、RPR 与 Sphinx 文档。"
msgstr "``pages``: the pages/ website, including downloads, RPR, and Sphinx documentation."

msgid "``htmldocs``：Documentation/html/，只构建手册，不构建镜像。"
msgstr "``htmldocs``: Documentation/html/; builds only the manual, without images."

msgid "all 包含 SDK 和三类镜像；release 再包含网站，均不自动上传。 文档与 Pages 的 Sphinx 依赖不影响单独构建内核和用户态。"
msgstr ""
"all includes the SDK and all three image types; release also includes the website. Neither uploads"
" automatically. The Sphinx dependencies of documentation and Pages do not affect standalone kernel"
" and userspace builds."

msgid "运行与发布"
msgstr "Running and publishing"

msgid ""
"``make run``、run-iso、run-installer 启动对应介质。 默认 ``QEMU_BOOT=uefi`` 使用 OVMF；``QEMU_BOOT=bios`` 使用 "
"SeaBIOS。 可覆盖 CPUS、MEMORY 和 QEMU 变量；无 KVM 的宿主用 ``QEMU_KVM=0``。"
msgstr ""
"``make run``, run-iso, and run-installer start the corresponding media. The default "
"``QEMU_BOOT=uefi`` uses OVMF; ``QEMU_BOOT=bios`` uses SeaBIOS. CPUS, MEMORY, and QEMU variables "
"can be overridden; use ``QEMU_KVM=0`` on hosts without KVM."

msgid ""
"RPR、下载页与文档组装为一个 Pages 输出；RPR 签名、APK 索引和内核摘要保持 机器契约，不因文档主题更换而改变。发布目标要求内核 clean 且等于主仓 gitlink。 "
"真实版本发布见 :doc:`../process/releasing`。"
msgstr ""
"RPR, download pages, and documentation are assembled into one Pages output. RPR signatures, APK "
"indexes, and kernel digests retain their machine contracts regardless of documentation theme "
"changes. Release targets require a clean kernel checkout matching this repository's gitlink. For "
"actual version releases, see :doc:`../process/releasing`."

msgid "文档与 RPR"
msgstr "Documentation and RPR"

msgid ""
"完整 Pages 网站分别从主仓 Documentation/ 和所选 ReliefNT 仓库的 Documentation/ 读取源文档，生成 docs/reliefos/ 与 "
"docs/reliefnt/，docs/index.html 是产品入口。 两份手册使用各自的 Sphinx 配置和版本，不把内核源文档复制到主仓维护。 RPR "
"首页及内核下载页链接到相应手册，APK 索引、公钥、health 与内核发布元数据 路径保持原协议。独立 rpr-pages 仍只装配包和内核子树，可供 RPR 客户端使用； "
"页面中的站点导航和文档链接依赖完整 Pages 父目录，预览完整网站应使用 pages。 完整手册由 pages 发布。 任一手册构建失败时，保留上次完整网站，不发布部分文档。"
msgstr ""
"The complete Pages website reads documentation from this repository's Documentation/ and the "
"selected ReliefNT repository's Documentation/, generating docs/reliefos/ and docs/reliefnt/; "
"docs/index.html is the product entry point. The two manuals use their own Sphinx configurations "
"and versions; kernel documentation is not copied into this repository for maintenance. The RPR "
"home page and kernel download page link to the corresponding manuals, while APK index, public key,"
" health, and kernel release metadata paths retain their protocols. Standalone rpr-pages still "
"assembles only the package and kernel subtrees for RPR clients. Site navigation and documentation "
"links on those pages depend on the complete Pages parent directory; use pages to preview the full "
"website. Complete manuals are published by pages. If either manual fails to build, the last "
"complete website is retained and no partial documentation is published."
